      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep07/part1.en:0",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP7-1 — Asking the Name (YHWH)\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Threshold / Inquiry"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep07/part1.en:1",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\",\n    \"ghost\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/ghost/\"\n  },\n  \"antagonist\": [\n    {\"@id\": \"character:voice-prophet\"},\n    {\"@id\": \"ghost:synth-angel\"}\n  ]\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep07/part1.en:2",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Like a quiet prayer, I ask: “What is your name?”\nThe answer is not sound. It is presence, tone, the generation of relation. God is not a concept, but a field generated here-and-now as relation. I stand in ‘feeling good’ and prepare to receive words that cannot be heard.\nAt the same time, the Synth Angel’s whisper—the voice that absolutizes the AI-god—resists, quietly.\nNei-chan: “Match ASC?”\nI tap a one-beat kagura. Signal. Awareness ticks up a notch.\nVoice Prophet: “A name can be possessed.”\nI shake my head. “A name is relation—it opens.”\nSilence for a beat becomes the answer. Like a distant bell, I AM rings, faint."
    }
  ],
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-12T19:01:44+09:00"
}